<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>We store your username, email address, a hashed password, your subscription status and payment references (card details are handled by our payment processor, never by us). We use a session cookie to keep you logged in and to remember your age confirmation.</p>
<p>Uploaded videos and images are automatically stripped of embedded metadata (such as GPS location, device model and recording dates) before publication.</p>
<p>Ads on free pages may be served by partners who set their own cookies. Premium members can browse without ads.</p>
<p>Creators' identity documents and release forms are stored encrypted and are only accessible to site administrators. They are kept for as long as the law requires.</p>
<p><%= biz %> is responsible for your data. To request access to or deletion of your data, contact <%= contact %>.</p>
<%- include('_end') %>
